type: software
title: "MathCanvas: AI-Native Interactive 2D/3D Geometry, Higher Mathematics & CAD Workbench"
version: "6.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
authors:
  - alias: "Huo0077"
    website: "https://github.com/Huo0077"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Huo0077/mathcanvas"
url: "https://huo0077.github.io/mathcanvas/"
abstract: >-
  MathCanvas is an AI-native interactive mathematics workbench for Windows, Android, and the Web.
  It unifies natural-language problem-to-diagram AI generation (gated by an independent mathematical
  verification certificate), reactive 2D analytic geometry & conics, 3D solid geometry with dynamic
  point bindings and exact spatial angle radicals, a 10-module university higher-mathematics visual
  laboratory (extrema, Lagrange multipliers, 3D surfaces, ODE/phase planes, 60fps WebWorker PDE
  simulations, Taylor/Fourier series, double integrals, linear algebra SVD, and probability/CLT),
  and four-view CAD projection.
